。」於是懷王許之，竟不合秦，而合齊以善韓。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002034","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"昭雎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001945","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0083","start":83,"end":86,"surface":"樗裏疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001972","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"韓先王墓的未定指代，未與楚先王或其他王名相接。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0222","start":222,"end":226,"surface":"韓公子眛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001975","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0239","start":239,"end":240,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0251","start":251,"end":254,"surface":"樗裏疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001972","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0255","start":255,"end":256,"surface":"疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001972","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0268","start":268,"end":269,"surface":"疾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001972","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0280","start":280,"end":283,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001972","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m076-0298","start":298,"end":300,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p079","text":"楚大臣患之，乃相與謀曰：「吾王在秦不得還，要以割地，而太子爲質於齊，齊、秦合謀，則楚無國矣。」乃欲立懷王子在國者。昭雎曰：「王與太子倶困於諸侯，而今又倍王命而立其庶子，不宜。」乃詐赴於齊，齊湣王謂其相曰：「不若留太子以求楚之淮北。」相曰：「不可，郢中立王，是吾抱空質而行不義於天下也。」或曰：「不然。郢中立王，因與其新王市曰『予我下東國，吾爲王殺太子，不然，將與三國共立之』，然則東國必可得矣。」齊王卒用其相計而歸楚太子。太子橫至，立爲王，是爲頃襄王。乃告于秦曰：「賴社稷神靈，國有王矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"懷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"子在國者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定成員，未由子蘭等既有人名補具體個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"昭雎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001945","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m079-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001924","status":"contextual_provisional"